  "releaseNotes": "NEW: Upgrade support for Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore to version 10.0.1\nNEW: Upgrade support for Npgsql.EntityFrameworkCore.PostgreSQL to version 10.0.0\nFIX: Added guards for NullReferenceException from RabbitMQ.Client instrumentation\nNEW: Upgrade support for ServiceStack.Redis to version 10.0.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for Microsoft.Azure.Functions.Worker to version 2.51.0\nFIX: Reintroduced INSTANA_ALLOW_ROOT_EXIT_SPAN to give customers the option to set it to false, since having an Exit Span as the Root Span is not required for some customers\nNEW: Upgrade support for StackExchange.Redis to version 2.10.1",
